    "created_at": "2025-02-17T15:00:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-02-17T15:00:32Z",
    "body": "If we want to erase the distinction of \"`ImageData` is special\" then one could also make an argument that one should be able to `putImageData` with any other `CanvasImageSource`. But for the moment I'll just update the text of the spec to reflect the conversions.",
